.TH SWAYDESK-SESSIONMGR 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.3" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-sessionmgr \- minimal org.gnome.SessionManager for Sway
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-sessionmgr
.SH DESCRIPTION
Answers only Reboot and Shutdown of org.gnome.SessionManager, for the "Restart and update" of GNOME Software; the other methods return UnknownMethod. The Sway configuration starts it, never D\-Bus activation, and it exits with the session.
.PP
The session runs it under the name sway\-sessionmgr (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-sessionmgr); the process name is sway\-sessionmgr too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7)
